Z||000000||loafer87gt||01-18-2000||12:58 AM||||I finally scanned some of my pics of my car and thought I'd share one with you. This is a neat Pontiac Promo plate I got from my local dealership. When the new Firebirds came out they received a batch of these plates and they were nice enough to give me one to put on my GT. One piece of warning though, when I put the plate on my car to go to a car show, every guy and his dog wanted to race me. Needless to say, I held my own though. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A> <BR>||||reg||14
